{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c4e5","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06eb9-f212-7283-9b75-ad2ced5e882d"},"sequence":205,"recorded_at":1780531400000405,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"d7aaf52d-f59b-4e18-a931-19c896b89f9b","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"d7aaf52d-f59b-4e18-a931-19c896b89f9b","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"d7aaf52d-f59b-4e18-a931-19c896b89f9b"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"8c35751a-df0d-496a-9b89-d4ff29987d19"},"task_id":"8c35751a-df0d-496a-9b89-d4ff29987d19","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"8c35751a-df0d-496a-9b89-d4ff29987d19","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-9-1\",\n  \"command\": \"ls internal/specdoc/; grep -n \\\"4\\\\.A\\\\|4\\\\.1\\\\|6\\\\.5\\\\|7\\\\.A\\\\|Manifest\\\\|Probe\\\\|capabilit\\\\|generation\\\\|dependenc\\\\|expir\\\\|admission\\\" internal/specdoc/SPEC.md | head -80; wc -l internal/specdoc/SPEC.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Locate manifest/probe spec sections\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"embed_reach_test.go\\nSPEC.md\\nspecdoc_test.go\\nspecdoc.go\\n30:<code>ax doctor</code>, and is never advertised as an available capability.\\n55:13. produce and execute an exact, expiring Continuation Plan through existing\\n86:| Provider adapter | Plugin protocol and only the capabilities advertised by probe |\\n130:| Terminal capability evidence | <code>urn:ax:schema:terminal-capability-evidence</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n158:| Clone Raw Object Manifest | <code>urn:ax:schema:clone-raw-object-manifest</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n159:| Clone Capture Manifest | <code>urn:ax:schema:clone-capture-manifest</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n160:| Clone Bundle Manifest | <code>urn:ax:schema:session-clone-bundle</code> | <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n166:| Clone Projected Object Manifest | <code>urn:ax:schema:clone-projected-object-manifest</code> |